    "lawCode": "Amd §620, Gen Muni L",
    "lawSection": "General Municipal Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S5863\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to amend the general municipal law, in relation to the Freeport\ncommunity development agency\n\n\n PURPOSE :\nTo amend the general municipal law, in relation to the Freeport\ncommunity development agency.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\nSection 1 amends section 620 of the general municipal law allow the\nmayor to appoint members to the Freeport community development agency.\n\nSection 2. Effective immediately.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nAt the request of the Village of Freeport, this legislation would\nallow the Freeport Community Development Agency to comply with the\nPublic Authorities Accountability Act of 2005. The act requires\ncertain financial reporting and disclosure to the \"local legislative\nbody\" within the agency's jurisdiction. In Freeport's case the\nlegislative body and agency's corporate structure are identical,\nmaking any reporting done by the agency essentially self reporting.\n\nThis Legislation would allow the Mayor of the Village of Freeport to\nappoint four members to the Freeport Community Development Agency,\nallowing them to fully comply with the Public Accountability Act of\n2005.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
